("place.wrack-line", "light", "unseen")
("place.wrack-line", "paragraph", "Two learners find a ribbon of shells beside the imagined shore. One writes that the tide arranged them. The other records a curved line of pale shapes. Only the second sentence separates a visible pattern from its explanation.")
("place.wrack-line", "fullParagraph", "Write what you could point to before explaining what made it.")
("place.wrack-line", "instruction", "Write what you could point to before explaining what made it.")
