("place.pool-window", "paragraph", "A dark patch appears solid when Mira looks from the path. In an invented sketch from another angle, it breaks into small shapes. Neither sketch proves what lives there. A changed viewpoint makes a new question possible.")
("place.pool-window", "fullParagraph", "Keep both sketches and label their viewpoints.")
