("place.shell-table", "light", "human")
("place.shell-table", "paragraph", "At the shell table, Ren proposes that similar shapes share a cause. Lou proposes that the collector preferred those shapes. Both stories fit this fictional collection. They write down a record that might distinguish the stories instead of voting for a winner.")
("place.shell-table", "fullParagraph", "Name an observation that would change each interpretation.")
("place.shell-table", "instruction", "Name an observation that would change each interpretation.")
